 "stark_openreview": {
  "forum": "QSS5cGmKb1",
  "source": "web.archive.org capture 20260430203713 of api2.openreview.net notes",
  "md5": "ce8c6c49debd24bad92b6cd81b404ad8",
  "notes": 13,
  "kinds": {
   "Decision": 1,
   "Official_Comment": 4,
   "Rebuttal": 4,
   "Official_Review": 3,
   "Submission": 1
  },
  "matches": [
   {
    "note": "auK7T92UiE",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "Besides, all baseline results on the human-generated dataset are also provided to reflect the data quality"
   },
   {
    "note": "auK7T92UiE",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "Note that we used two different LLMs in `Step 3: Combining relational and textual requirements` to rewrite the querie, and three LLMs to validate the answer"
   },
   {
    "note": "auK7T92UiE",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "### **Comment 4: Human-generated query as seed**"
   },
   {
    "note": "auK7T92UiE",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "This is a great idea! We think human-generated queries will be a great addition to increase query types"
   },
   {
    "note": "auK7T92UiE",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "Additionally, we have discussed potential future improvements, including the use of human-generated queries to increase query diversity"
   },
   {
    "note": "joGoWB6HT9",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "### **Comment 2: Experimental results on sampled synthetic dataset and human-generated dataset**"
   },
   {
    "note": "joGoWB6HT9",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "Regarding the Recall@20 metric on the human-generated dataset, our previous concern was that this metric may downweight queries with more than 20 answers (e"
   },
   {
    "note": "vkPAZmD4bF",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "”| `We clarify that all synthetic and human-generated data, SKB data, and code are fully available"
   },
   {
    "note": "vkPAZmD4bF",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "rebuttal",
    "text": "BM25…dense retrieval methods like ANCE and TAS-B”|”Comparisons with human-generated datasets are also conducted, enhancing the reliability of the results"
   },
   {
    "note": "H2J3YntoaP",
    "by": "Reviewer_bote",
    "field": "review",
    "text": "* Comparisons with human-generated datasets are also conducted, enhancing the reliability of the results"
   },
   {
    "note": "VhJHDN8PA2",
    "by": "Reviewer_CdN8",
    "field": "review",
    "text": "The authors seem to disentangle this by using human generated queries in their analysis"
   },
   {
    "note": "VhJHDN8PA2",
    "by": "Reviewer_CdN8",
    "field": "review",
    "text": "Moreover, they do not include results with dense retrieval models in the human generated data, which could be a good way to gauge if there are biases induced by the LLMs in their synthetic data evaluation"
   },
   {
    "note": "VhJHDN8PA2",
    "by": "Reviewer_CdN8",
    "field": "documentation",
    "text": "In my opinion, the human generated dataset, despite being small in size, would be a great contribution to the community as it could be used as the starting point for others to build on top of it"
   },
   {
    "note": "QSS5cGmKb1",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "abstract",
    "text": "We design a novel pipeline to synthesize realistic user queries that integrate diverse relational information and complex textual properties, together with their ground-truth answers (items)"
   },
   {
    "note": "QSS5cGmKb1",
    "by": "Authors",
    "field": "abstract",
    "text": "We further enhance the benchmark with high-quality human-generated queries to provide an authentic reference"
   }
  ]
 },
